{#
Audit rule/evidence consistency judge prompt.

Required variables:
  note: Full post text from AuditInput.note. Multimodal images are attached
    separately from AuditInput.images in the same order as the <image>
    placeholders, when available.
  candidate_labels: Normalized AuditInput.candidate_labels.
  gt_labels: Exactly one normalized label from the xlsx_correct_label round,
    stored in the same list format as AuditInput.gt_labels.
  rules: List[RuleInfo] / list[dict] in the same shape used by the audit agent.
    Each item must expose label, rule_text, and optionally rule_images/raw.
  tool_section: Pre-rendered complete observations for all nine audit tools in
    the same format used by the four-stage Main Final / Judge prompts. Keep
    each tool's name, status, text result, and <image> placeholders. Attach
    available tool-result images separately after the post images, preserving
    exact placeholder/image order. Use an empty string only when no tool cache
    is available for the case.

The caller must populate gt_labels from xlsx_correct_label rather than the
legacy row label. The template accepts a scalar string defensively, but the
canonical contract is a one-element list such as ["通过"].
#}
{% if gt_labels is string -%}
{% set gt = gt_labels | trim -%}
{% elif gt_labels -%}
{% set gt = gt_labels[0] | trim -%}
